{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "10350c03-7d5c-813f-b77f-18935708a036",
  "created_at": "2026-02-02T11:27:57-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Zoning and Inspections",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Rachel Haddad",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Greg Lombardi",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T11:24:38-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Zoning and Inspections, this is Greg."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T11:24:41-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi. My name is Rachel Haddad. I want to put up a fence. I'm not sure if I need a permit."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T11:24:49-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Is this at a home you own, or are you renting?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T11:24:54-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Renting. 474 Memorial Boulevard. Over by Easton's Beach."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T11:24:58-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. And what kind of fence are we talking about?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T11:25:02-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Black aluminum. About four and a half feet tall. It's for my dog. She slips out of the yard. She gets under the gate and goes."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T11:25:11-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright. Generally, yes, a fence needs a permit here, and height is part of that. Four and a half feet is something we'd want to look at on paper."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T11:25:21-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So I need a permit. Or do I just call the city and tell them? I don't understand which one it is."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T11:25:29-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's an application, not just a phone call. Telling us over the phone doesn't count as the permit. Since you rent, though, your landlord would have to be okay with it too."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T11:25:40-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The landlord. Okay. So he applies? Or I do?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T11:25:44-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Either one can usually file, but the owner has to sign off. Ask him first. If he's on board, you can come in or we can email you the form."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T11:25:54-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I thought the fence company does that part."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T11:25:57-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sometimes they do, yeah. Some contractors will pull it for you. Ask whoever you hire. If you're doing it yourself, it comes through us."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T11:26:06-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. I haven't hired anybody yet. What does it cost? The fee."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T11:26:11-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I don't have the number in front of me, and it can depend on the job. Let me put you on hold and check on that. One minute."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T11:26:21-05:00",
      "duration": 1,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T11:26:22-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "[pause] Sorry, still with you? I'm waiting on someone to pick up."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T11:26:27-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'm here. I'm always on hold when it matters. I'll live."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T11:26:31-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Fair enough. Okay, I'm back. The fee is based on the cost of the work, so it'll be tied to what the fence quote says. The form spells it out."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T11:26:41-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So I need the quote first. Then the fee."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T11:26:45-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right, the quote first. Then the fee gets figured from that. Also, bring a simple sketch of where it goes on the lot."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T11:26:53-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A sketch. Like a drawing?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T11:26:56-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, just a rough layout. Your house, the property lines, and the fence line. Doesn't have to be fancy."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T11:27:03-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Landlord, quote, sketch, form. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T11:27:06-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's it. Do you want the form emailed or do you want to stop by?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T11:27:12-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Email is better. Can I give you a number? Or you need an email."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T11:27:17-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I can take a number and have someone follow up, or you can ask for the form at the counter. Which do you prefer?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T11:27:26-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Number. 401-555-0162."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T11:27:28-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0162. Got it. Someone will call you back about the form."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T11:27:32-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. I'm still not sure about the height part. Is four and a half feet a problem?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T11:27:38-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Probably not for a back yard, but I don't want to say for sure until it's on the sketch. Front yard can be different."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T11:27:47-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's the side and back. Okay. I'll talk to my landlord today."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T11:27:52-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sounds good. Thanks for calling, Rachel."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T11:27:55-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you."
    }
  ],
